sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant H as MCP Host
 participant S as MCP Server
 participant L as LinkedIn OAuth/API
 U->>H: Invoke tool / authorize
 H->>S: MCP request (authenticated as applicable)
 S->>S: Validate request and tenant
 S->>L: Delegated API call with protected token
 L-->>S: Authorized response
 S-->>H: Validated, minimized tool result
